            <ArticleTitle>The use of hypnosis in dentistry: a review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>198-202</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hypnosis is a valuable technique in patient management. With appropriate training, general dental practitioners can widen the treatment options they can offer to patients, especially those who are dentally anxious. This article provides a brief theoretical and historical overview, and a review of the literature pertaining to the clinical uses of hypnosis in dentistry.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
